                                "sense_id": "bd609906-2a70-36a8-8d4c-a82f835dac72",
                                "text": "It is essential that we maintain focus on originality as an ethical issue. A broader idea of creativity does not mean that 'anything goes' and sometimes attempts to reuse or remix the work of others becomes an ethical, even a legal, problem […]"
